# shieldkit — Version & CHANGELOG (MANDATORY)

Auto-attaches when editing matched library or release files. Invoke manually with **@shieldkit-release-changelog** if needed.

Before marking **any** implementation task complete, decide changelog and version impact. Do not skip this step.

Reference: `CHANGELOG.md` (Keep a Changelog + SemVer) · `docs/contributing/npm-publishing.md`

## 1. Changelog entry required?

**YES** — add bullets under `## [Unreleased]`:

- Public API changes (`src/index.ts`, exported types, consumer-facing config)
- Runtime behavior changes (guards, repair, tools, middleware, presets)
- Bug fixes and security fixes
- Deprecations, removals, or breaking changes
- User-facing README or npm metadata changes

**NO** — only when there is zero consumer impact: internal refactors, maintainer-only CI, comments, ephemeral `.cursor/plans/`.

When unsure → **add an entry**.

Use `### Added`, `Changed`, `Deprecated`, `Removed`, `Fixed`, or `Security`. Write user-facing bullets, not commit messages.

## 2. Version bump now or defer?

| Situation | Action |
| --------- | ------ |
| Normal feature/fix PR | `[Unreleased]` entry only — **do not** bump `package.json` |
| User asks to release, tag, or publish | Bump semver, date the section, update footer links |
| Breaking public API (when releasing) | **MAJOR** (`X.0.0`) |
| New backward-compatible feature (when releasing) | **MINOR** (`0.X.0`) |
| Bug or security fix, no API break (when releasing) | **PATCH** (`0.0.X`) |

Read current version from `package.json` — never guess.

On release: `package.json` version must match the new `## [X.Y.Z] - YYYY-MM-DD` heading; tag is `vX.Y.Z`.

## 3. Footer links (on release only)

Match existing `CHANGELOG.md` pattern:

```markdown
[Unreleased]: https://github.com/sakurablush/shieldkit/compare/vX.Y.Z...HEAD
[X.Y.Z]: https://github.com/sakurablush/shieldkit/compare/vPREV...vX.Y.Z
```

## 4. Final output (required)

State explicitly:

- **Changelog:** yes/no — category if yes
- **Version bump:** deferred / bumped to `X.Y.Z`
- **Files touched:** e.g. `CHANGELOG.md`, `package.json`

**Workflow detail:** `.cursor/skills/ai-shield-release-versioning/SKILL.md`
